<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>

<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Final Words 🎀</title>

<style>

*{
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
}

body{

margin:0;
min-height:100vh;

display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;

padding:20px;

overflow-x:hidden;

background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffeaf5,#fff6dc,#e8f8ff);

}


/* Background blobs */

.blob{

position:fixed;
border-radius:50%;
filter:blur(45px);
opacity:.35;
z-index:-1;

animation:float 8s infinite alternate;

}


.b1{

width:250px;
height:250px;
background:#ff8fc7;
top:-80px;
left:-80px;

}


.b2{

width:230px;
height:230px;
background:#ffd86b;
right:-70px;
top:200px;

}


.b3{

width:250px;
height:250px;
background:#8edcff;
bottom:-100px;
left:100px;

}



@keyframes float{

from{
transform:translateY(0);
}

to{
transform:translateY(40px);
}

}



/* Main card */

.card{

width:min(95vw,500px);

background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);

backdrop-filter:blur(10px);

padding:25px;

border-radius:35px;

box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.15);

animation:show .9s ease;

}



@keyframes show{

from{

opacity:0;
transform:translateY(60px);

}

to{

opacity:1;
transform:translateY(0);

}

}



/* Final box */

.final-box{

background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f2e8ff,#fff);

padding:22px;

border-radius:22px;

margin:18px 0;

text-align:center;

box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(210,180,255,.25);

animation:fade 1s ease;

}


@keyframes fade{

from{

opacity:0;
transform:scale(.9);

}

to{

opacity:1;
transform:scale(1);

}

}



h3{

color:#ff4f87;

font-size:22px;

}



p{

font-size:17px;

line-height:2;

color:#555;

}



/* Name highlight */

.name-box{

margin-top:25px;

padding:18px;

border-radius:18px;

background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff4d88,#ff7eb3);

color:white;

font-size:28px;

font-weight:bold;

box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,77,136,.5);

animation:pulse 1.8s infinite;

}



@keyframes pulse{

50%{

transform:scale(1.05);

}

}



/* Floating emojis */

.flower{

position:fixed;

bottom:-40px;

animation:rise linear infinite;

pointer-events:none;

}



@keyframes rise{

from{

transform:translateY(0) rotate(0deg);

opacity:1;

}

to{

transform:translateY(-110vh) rotate(360deg);

opacity:0;

}

}



/* Mobile */

@media(max-width:600px){

.card{

padding:18px;

border-radius:25px;

}

p{

font-size:15px;

}

.name-box{

font-size:22px;

}

}

</style>

</head>


<body>


<div class="blob b1"></div>
<div class="blob b2"></div>
<div class="blob b3"></div>



<div class="card">


<div class="final-box">


<h3>🎀 Final Words 🎀</h3>


<p>

Happy Friendship Day! 🌸💖<br><br>

Thank you for all the laughs, the memories, and every little moment we've shared. ✨<br><br>

Never change yourself just to make someone else happy.<br>

You are already amazing exactly the way you are. 💛<br><br>

Keep smiling. 🌸<br>

Keep shining. ✨<br>

Keep being the wonderful, funny, and amazing person you are. 🎀💖<br><br>

😂 And one more thing...<br>
Maybe spend a little more time studying... and a little less time thinking about Ishan. 📚🤭

</p>


<div class="name-box">

💖 TAKE CARE SHOLANKINI 🎀

</div>


<p style="margin-top:15px;font-size:16px;color:#888;">

🌸 See you again in another beautiful memory... 🎀✨

</p>


</div>


</div>



<script>

let emoji=[

"🎀","🌸","🌼","✨",

"💛","🦋","🌺","🌷","💖"

];


for(let i=0;i<45;i++){

let e=document.createElement("div");

e.className="flower";

e.innerHTML=emoji[Math.floor(Math.random()*emoji.length)];

e.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";

e.style.fontSize=(18+Math.random()*20)+"px";

e.style.animationDuration=(5+Math.random()*7)+"s";


document.body.appendChild(e);

}

</script>


</body>
</html>